englishFull:
परिमुखं च — ठक् comes after परिमुख (accusative) meaning "exists":

परिमुखं वर्तते → पारिमुखिकः (being before the face, present)

@note[च implies other words too: पारिपार्श्विकः। परिमुख is अव्ययीभाव (@ref[2.1.12]). If परि = exclusion (@ref[1.4.88]): servant avoiding master's face. If परि = all around: servant always present.]
